          "date": "2026-10-29 13:56:16.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-21060 utils: add client jobstats selectors",
        "message": "LU-21060 utils: add client jobstats selectors\n\nlljobstat has no OSC or MDC selector and does not recognize several\nclient metadata counters.  A record with only byte counters also\nleaves the operation total unset.\n\nAdd -O/--osc and -M/--mdc, recognize client operation names, and\ninitialize the operation total for byte-only records.  Add a\nstandalone CLI test that checks the complete lctl requests and\nparses directory-only and byte-only records.\n\nThis prepares the utility for the OSC/MDC interfaces in LU-21060.\nThe kernel interfaces are submitted separately.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Krause <akrause@nvidia.com>\nChange-Id: Icb9093c3e0d4d8b45a82bb4916d9695b0d63b07d\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
